OL,3,GNEWSALabour candidate wins city
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's Abbas Hussain has won a
OL,7,Fby-election for a seat on Nottingham
OL,8,FCity Council.
OL,10,FA by-election was held in the Leen
OL,11,FValley ward after Nadia Farhat, a
OL,12,Fformer Labour councillor, was removed
OL,13,Ffor failing to attend enough meetings.
OL,15,FShe was first elected to the ward in
OL,16,F2023, but defected to stand
OL,17,Findependently just months later over
OL,18,Fformer Prime Minister Sir Keir
OL,19,FStarmer's stance on the conflict in
OL,20,FGaza.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
