OL,3,GNEWSALabour candidate wins city
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoting took place on Thursday, with an
OL,7,Foverall turnout of 31.8%, and the
OL,8,Fresult was declared just after 00:00
OL,9,FBST on Friday at Loxley House.
